<title>UK: Desjardins sets C$100 mln six-year bond, +49 bp.</title>
<headline>Desjardins sets C$100 mln six-year bond, +49 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Tokyo Mitsubishi International and Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DESJARDINS DU QUEBEC</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    05.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.975   PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+49 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    QUEBEC    HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT SEPT 2001 CANADA -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
